    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Updates and Steam Next Fest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much to everyone supporting us! Steam Next Fest's results have exceeded our wildest hopes, and it has just begun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are constantly working on improving the game for everyone. Currently our focus is on Steam integration and bug fixing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improved stability on older and low-end devices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've added in the launch options menu to Steam. Now, when you play the game, you can choose if you want to use the Forward+ renderer (default option) or the compatibility renderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are running A Dark Forest on an older or low-end device, we very much recommend using the compatibility renderer! Especially if your version of A Dark Forest ever crashed on startup!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is dark and empty.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Dark Forest</i></strong> is an incremental idle horror game about discovering the unknown within and without yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/6f488af8d3dedab352ea2ec0baf7b9cf.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=564 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/6f488af8d3dedab352ea2ec0baf7b9cf.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/6f488af8d3dedab352ea2ec0baf7b9cf.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything the darkness touches is yours.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world,</strong> gather resources and carve out a community of your own inside the dark forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Remember\u2026 the Darkness never sleeps, and it doesn't like new challengers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/897bea63b309c0c22419192de2dc2ff3.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=252 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/897bea63b309c0c22419192de2dc2ff3.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/897bea63b309c0c22419192de2dc2ff3.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Savior or tyrant?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/c81ced55d082f1d61c5a15a9270f2597.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=352 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/c81ced55d082f1d61c5a15a9270f2597.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/c81ced55d082f1d61c5a15a9270f2597.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ward off 11 abyssal entities.</strong> Will you spare or execute them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There will be consequences\u2026 do you dare experience all endings?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/089f5a27f2a6908a2d2f859cc25a3c37.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=540 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/089f5a27f2a6908a2d2f859cc25a3c37.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/089f5a27f2a6908a2d2f859cc25a3c37.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >My good steward!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the faceless masses.</strong> Experience a strategic resource production chain mechanic and choose how you reign!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you implement absolute rule, allow for limited autonomy and freewill, or establish secretive freemasonry?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/142e2e45bc4d85fcf0f931b17eefe83a.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=344 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/142e2e45bc4d85fcf0f931b17eefe83a.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/142e2e45bc4d85fcf0f931b17eefe83a.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dear diary\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a twisting narrative.</strong> Will you shape the world, or be shaped by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you ever stop, or is your greed immeasurable?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/be526926bd282cb91ad2e9b6d372eb48.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=282 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/be526926bd282cb91ad2e9b6d372eb48.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/be526926bd282cb91ad2e9b6d372eb48.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is dark and empty.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Dark Forest</i></strong> is an incremental idle horror game about discovering the unknown within and without yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/6f488af8d3dedab352ea2ec0baf7b9cf.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=564 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/6f488af8d3dedab352ea2ec0baf7b9cf.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/6f488af8d3dedab352ea2ec0baf7b9cf.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything the darkness touches is yours.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world,</strong> gather resources and carve out a community of your own inside the dark forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Remember\u2026 the Darkness never sleeps, and it doesn't like new challengers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/897bea63b309c0c22419192de2dc2ff3.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=252 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/897bea63b309c0c22419192de2dc2ff3.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/897bea63b309c0c22419192de2dc2ff3.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Savior or tyrant?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea