290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/142e2e45bc4d85fcf0f931b17eefe83a.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/142e2e45bc4d85fcf0f931b17eefe83a.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dear diary\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a twisting narrative.</strong> Will you shape the world, or be shaped by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you ever stop, or is your greed immeasurable?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/be526926bd282cb91ad2e9b6d372eb48.poster.avif?t=1749838155\" width=282 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/be526926bd282cb91ad2e9b6d372eb48.webm?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/be526926bd282cb91ad2e9b6d372eb48.mp4?t=1749838155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
